!USES: This file provides thermodynamic data suitable for modeling the gas-phase
!oxidation of TiCl4 from O2 (or air), inCluding typical CVD pressures and
!temperatures and with or without H2O. They may also be used to model the
!thermal decomposition (pyrolysis) of TiCl4 in the absence of O2. However, the file
!does not inClude species needed to model NOx formation. Inert carrier gases 
